lean/Taut/Theorem3Clean.lean:3608:    (hU : UnitOn X σ) (hXc : bdry X = 0) (hMX : bdry M = X) (hT : IsTaut M)
lean/Taut/Theorem3Clean.lean:3609:    (hS : SimplicialChain M) : IsCleanBall M.support σ := by
lean/Taut/Theorem3Clean.lean:3615:3-complex* — `Pure3 ∧ TriangleBounded3 ∧ Normal3`, where `Normal3 = EdgeLinkConnected ∧
lean/Taut/Theorem3Clean.lean:3616:VertexLinkConnected`.  This makes the paper's "normal" condition (connected vertex *and* edge links)
lean/Taut/Theorem3Clean.lean:3617:a first-class named conclusion rather than something a consumer must unpack from `IsCleanBall`.
lean/Taut/Theorem3Clean.lean:3618:In particular `(taut_clean3Complex …).2.2.2 : VertexLinkConnected M.support`. -/
